22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong s... View Details Bookmark Assistant Wrestling Coach Wrestling SP00876 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduate, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong se... View Details Bookmark Director, Kathryn Hughes Seaber Raider Academic Center for Student-Athletes Student Retention SP00874 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduates, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong s... View Details Bookmark Assistant Women's Lacrosse Coach Lacrosse SP00871 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduate, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong se... View Details Bookmark Assistant Strength/Conditioning Coach Sports Medicine SP00868 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduate, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong se... View Details Bookmark Assistant Women's Basketball Coach Woman's Basketball SP00872 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduate, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong se... View Details Bookmark PDO Professional Development Coordinator (SCUPA/GFPC 1) Teacher Education SP00873 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduates, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong s... View Details Bookmark Fiscal Technician -- Student Accounts Bursar SP00867 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduate, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong se... View Details Bookmark Assistant/Associate Professor - Communication, Journalism and Media Communication, Journalism and Media FP00259 The Department of Communication, Journalism and Media, an ACEJMC-accredited program, is seeking candidates with broad expertise in multimedia production, visual media, and generative AI tools, who can help meet core departmental teaching needs at the undergraduate and graduate levels for the position of Assistant/Associate Professor of Communication, Journalism and Media, effective August 2027.... View Details Bookmark Instructor - English English FP00258 The Department of English at Shippensburg University invites applications for either full-time or part-time temporary positions teaching academic writing beginning Fall 2026. Ability to teach general education literature would be considered valuable but is not required. These classes will be taught in-person, on-campus. In addition, faculty members are expected to perform other duties as assign... View Details Bookmark Student Teaching Supervisor Teacher Education FP00256 The Department of Teacher Education seeks instructors to supervise student teachers. Selected candidates will be added to a team of university supervisors who will be used on an as-needed basis during the fall and spring semesters.As a university supervisor, you will oversee the student teaching experience for assigned students. Primary duties include mentoring, instructional coaching, and coll... View Details Bookmark Instructor - Global Languages & Cultures Global Languages & Cultures FP00257 The Department of Global Languages and Cultures at Shippensburg University of Pennsylvania invites applications for a full-year, three-quarter-time adjunct position specializing in German language and German culture to begin in August 2026. We seek a dynamic teacher-scholar committed to excellence in language instruction and innovative pedagogical practices.The successful candidate will contrib... View Details Bookmark Police Officer Public Safety SP00845 Join a vibrant and purpose-driven community at Shippensburg University, located in the scenic Cumberland Valley and spread across a beautiful 210-acre campus with over 40 buildings. We offer a dynamic academic environment with 45 undergraduates, 22 graduate, and 2 doctoral programs. At Shippensburg, our mission is more than words—we are committed to inclusive collaboration, fostering a strong s... View Details Bookmark This page is an official publication of Shippensburg University: A member of the Pennsylvania State System of Higher Education . Shippensburg University - 1871 Old Main Drive - Shippensburg, PA 17257 - (717) 477-7447 Ask a Question/Provide Feedback | Privacy Statement | View on Mobile To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
